<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-primary">Surgical Treatment</h3>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-6">
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Incision and Drainage</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">For fluctuant abscesses — surgical drainage at CARE Hospitals operating rooms with immediate pain relief and culture sampling. <a href="facial-abscess-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline">Facial abscess treatment</a> has full details.</p></li>
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Tooth Extraction or Root Canal</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Dental-origin cheek swelling requires definitive source treatment — extraction or root canal of the affected tooth to prevent recurrence.</p></li>
</ul>
